- Module 1: Foundations of Counseling Ethics (45 minutes)
- Module 2: Ethical Decision-Making Models (30 minutes)
- Module 3: Professional Boundaries in Therapeutic Relationships (30 minutes)
- Module 4: Confidentiality, Privilege, and Mandated Reporting (30 minutes)
- Module 5: Navigating Dual and Multiple Relationships (25 minutes)
- Module 6: Building Your Ethical Practice Plan (20 minutes)
- Final Assessment (10 minutes)

