   a) Consultants always share responsibility for cases
   b) Consultees retain full clinical and ethical responsibility
   c) There is no difference in responsibility
   d) Supervisees retain full responsibility

2. According to the ACA Code of Ethics, consultation should be sought:
   a) Only during the first year of licensure
   b) When counselors have questions about ethical obligations or professional practice
   c) Only for high-risk cases
   d) Only when mandated by employers

3. Which is NOT a characteristic of professional consultation?
   a) Voluntary participation
   b) Problem-focused
