Reiter, J. T., Dobmeyer, A. C., & Hunter, C. L. (2018). *Integrated behavioral health in primary care: A guide to effective implementation* (2nd ed.). American Psychological Association.

Remley, T. P., & Herlihy, B. (2020). *Ethical, legal, and professional issues in counseling* (6th ed.). Pearson.

